<title>RUSSIA: Fifth Reuters ex-Moscow air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Fifth Reuters ex-Moscow air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Moscow air cargo market rates in U.S. dollars per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to weight ratio of six-to-one:</p>
<p>						 Sept 19   Aug 19</p>
<p>	     EUROPE</p>
<p>SVO (Moscow-Sheremetyevo)-FRA	    1.12	1.12</p>
<p>SVO-LON					  1.21	1.21</p>
<p>SVO-LUX					  1.36	1.36</p>
<p>		ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p>SVO-BKK					  3.65	3.65</p>
<p>SVO-SEL					  4.50	4.50</p>
<p>SVO-NRT					  4.66	4.66</p>
<p>		  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>SVO-DXB					  2.20	2.20</p>
<p>SVO-SHJ					  2.58	2.58</p>
<p>		 UNITED STATES</p>
<p>SVO-MIA					  3.52	3.52</p>
<p>SVO-NYC					  2.94	2.94</p>
<p>SVO-SFO					  3.60	3.60</p>
<p>* The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Moscow's Sheremetyevo international airport.</p>
<p>	    * All prices are quoted in U.S. dollars</p>
<p>	    * The tariffs represent average rates calculated from</p>
<p>a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
